sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant T as Stack del consumidor
    participant K as API de Kubernetes
    participant CM as Controlador de cert-manager
    participant AP as approver-policy
    participant CA as ClusterIssuer internal-ca

    T->>K: Certificate keycloak-tls (ns keycloak)<br/>dnsNames: keycloak-service.keycloak.svc
    K->>CM: reconciliar
    CM->>K: CertificateRequest
    K->>AP: evaluar contra las CertificateRequestPolicy
    alt SANs bajo *.keycloak.svc y *.keycloak.svc.cluster.local
        AP->>K: Approved
        CM->>CA: firmar
        CA-->>CM: certificado
        CM->>K: Secret keycloak-tls
    else un SAN de otro namespace (p. ej. *.sonarqube.svc)
        AP->>K: Denied con el motivo
        Note over K: el Certificate no llega a Ready,<br/>alerta de plataforma a los 15 min
    end
